                                                "sense_id": "06894c1c-d961-33d9-96b4-b4cffd361d36",
                                                "text": "A peculiar and important rank in the Armenian hierarchy, conferred by a sort of ordination rite, is that of vartapet. He is a hieromonk or widowed priest of superior learning and ability, especially authorized to preach and teach."
                                            }
